<title>Editing a Memo</title>

<p>If you want to change a memo that already exists in your memo lists,</p>

<steps>
<item><p>Double-click on the memo that you want to edit in the list of memos, or right-click on the memo and click <gui>Open Memo</gui>.</p></item>
<item><p>Edit the memo information.</p></item>
<item><p>Clique no botão <gui style="button">Salvar</gui> ou <guiseq><gui>Arquivo</gui><gui>Salvar</gui></guiseq>.</p></item>
</steps>
</page>
